Not an analysis project — do not deploy pipeline scripts/config here.

This is the v1.0 project directory. It is retained for one reason: it holds the
image files that LIVE projects still point at via their server.json, notably

    M3_20x_MIP_Z1-3.ome.tiff
    M3_20x_MIP_Z1-3_MIP.ome.tiff
    M3_20x_hybrid_dapiZ2_mipZ0-2.ome.tiff

which are referenced by "M3 Hippocampus 20x 062926 3 plane" entries 1-3, and

    M3_20x_MIP.ome.tiff

referenced by this project's own entry.

Do NOT move or rename this directory without first rewriting those server.json
URIs — QuPath stores absolute paths and will silently fail to open the images.

scripts/sync_project.py --all skips any project containing this file.
